# SwiftFormat config for RTI (Phase 0 lint gate).
#
# Minimal on purpose: pin the Swift version so local and CI agree, and otherwise
# use SwiftFormat's default rules. CI lints ONLY newly-added Swift files (see
# .github/workflows/ci.yml). The legacy tree predates SwiftFormat and follows
# none of its conventions, so linting modified files would force a full reformat
# on every one-line touch; new code (the growing RTICore) is held to this style.
#
# Run locally before pushing a new file:
#   swiftformat --lint <new-file>     # check
#   swiftformat <new-file>            # auto-fix

--swiftversion 6.0
